{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2026-04", "window": 1, "start_date": 1775001600, "end_date": 1777593599, "month_true_total": 20, "quota": 20, "returned": 20, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:58:06 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "224126976", "author": {"steamid": "76561197974259663", "personaname": "Beizelby", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Beizelby/", "num_games_owned": 582, "num_reviews": 91, "playtime_forever": 595, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 498, "last_played": 1777709273, "avatar": "63ed185d14dd4b2e6d882dfab704e1a2b3f78b81"}, "language": "english", "review": "“Do you like bugs? No? Good—because you’ll spend hours screaming at them while wearing a jetpack and accidentally blowing up half your team.\n\nEarth Defense Force 5 is what happens when a B-movie about alien invasions gets turned into a game and handed a ridiculous amount of explosives. The plot exists (technically), but mostly as an excuse for you to shout “EDF!” while unloading rockets into giant enemies.\n\nSo much fun making a mess!\n\nI'm doing my part!", "timestamp_created": 1777196013, "timestamp_updated": 1777196122, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224013818", "author": {"steamid": "76561198003557549", "personaname": "Everdark", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/EverdarkOne/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 139, "playtime_forever": 1661, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1661, "last_played": 1777068012, "avatar": "79e5f6abf0b5ee0d1c74c7a30ee6462449808cd3"}, "language": "english", "review": "In small portions, it's fine entertainment. I