offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tsaishen/", "num_games_owned": 299, "num_reviews": 71, "playtime_forever": 909, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 816, "last_played": 1777434205, "avatar": "da4b6f8c44d0d59b267652c2719d78a4fbdcb835"}, "language": "english", "review": "probably one of the best edf games, new systems are cool, design changes are unfortunate though, especially fencer", "timestamp_created": 1776311685, "timestamp_updated": 1776311843, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.512195110321044922", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223304287", "author": {"steamid": "76561198967034272", "personaname": "DivInflux", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/divinflux/", "num_games_owned": 125, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 523, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 523, "last_played": 1754656292, "avatar": "995af516392a94f5fa67892985e094ebe2e68a77"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is so ridiculous, janky and overal ass to play, that I am genuinely certain, you need some form of Stockholm Syndrome to actually come back to this literal ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ after the first time.\n\nI feel like the Store Page speaks for itself.\n\nAnd I unfortunately do not have Stockholm Syndrome.", "timestamp_created": 1776256907, "timestamp_updated": 1776257158, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.38846743106842041", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223249764", "author": {"steamid": "76561198313096359", "personaname": "imagnifica", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/imagnfica/", "num_games_owned": 146, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1612, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1274, "last_played": 1786116333, "avatar": "37cf1dc1f48ac849fb89a0b11182816609a9e6eb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Probably the most stupid story I've ever witnessed. I've never quite experienced something like having to pause after every single piece of dialouge to think \"why would they write that?\"\nAnd honestly? I can't get enough of it. I love how campy it is. Killing bugs with orbiral laser barrages is very fun (and better with friends). 110 missions / 10 would compare bipedal frogs the size of buildings to humans on the basis that they have two eyes again", "timestamp_created": 1776181654, "timestamp_updated": 1776181654, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.543189346790313721", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223113970", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045680502", "personaname": "Rodal Bevit", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ELITECAM/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 3472, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3472, "last_played": 1632641070, "avatar": "deffb049951bd0cc3025e595e2e6bf72b3c557d0"}, "language": "english", "review": "I thought it was fun to shoot bugs.", "timestamp_created": 1776006971, "timestamp_updated": 1776006971, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.547325074672698975", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223077222", "author": {"steamid": "76561198878192227", "personaname": "Kazu1chi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198878192227/", "num_games_owned": 357, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 18777, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 122, "playtime_at_review": 10810, "last_played": 1790449163, "avatar": "2f402e83f2fdde1d3c10afd64f28bc19356b86a1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game terbaik yang pernah saya mainkan.\r\n\r\nMemang saya cuman baru 180 jam main game ini tapi saya merasa lebih menghargai usaha yang dilakukan.\r\n\r\nSaya di game lain sudah rank 999 dan playtime lebih dari seribu jam dan armor full upgrade,\r\nTapi saya tetep saja 2 kali kena damage monster engame bakal mati.\r\n\r\nSementara game ini bisa unlock limit defence jadi off yang buat perkembangan bisa terus dilakukan.\r\nBedanya dari game lain, defence itu sebuah permanen attribute yg didapat dari drop musuh bukan dari equipment yg permanen dengan limitasi permanen juga.\r\n\r\nApalah arti dari rank 999 jika gagal bantuin orang lain karena defence ga bisa naik lebih dari 450 meskipun full upgrade.", "timestamp_created": 1775967797, "timestamp_updated": 1775967797, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.498675674200057983", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "hardware": {"system_ram": "16226", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12400F", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060", "vram_size": 12113}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223020768", "author": {"steamid": "76561199816437197", "personaname": "RIPPER", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199816437197/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29,